                     <title>Relatio de Willelmo conquestore</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Hereford P.v.1 and Bodl. e Mus. 93 formed one
                        volume, earlier probably at BATTLE, q.v. Sir John Prise found it 'in
                        Brechonia Demetarum . . . urbe . . . ex coenobio Monachorum, quod ibidem
                        erat Benedictini, quem vocant, ordine desumptum' (J. Prise, Historiae
                        Brytanniae Defensio, 1573, p. 114).</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
               <history>
                  <origin>
